# WFORMTQ.KEY - a memo save that fails part-way, in the form of every
# type of TEST/WFORMT.C: MM_PARTIAL in a message box, then the failure,
# the dialog staying; OK, the memo not touched again, sends the whole
# memo again, and view mode shows it; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTQ.SNP.
K F5
T x
K ENTER
# COND holds no word of its choices; the first one, then the memo, on
# the Notes page.
K DOWN CTRL-TAB
T PART
K CTRL-ENTER
T second line
K ENTER
S PARTIAL
K ENTER
S FAILED
# The focus back on OK: OK again, unedited, saves and ends the dialog.
K ENTER ENTER
S SAVED
K F6
S VIEW
K ESC
